C    Q     Q     G   GGG     SSSS           J    EEEEE         T       C
C    Q   Q Q     G     G         S          J    E             T       C
C     Q   Q       G   G     S    S     J   J     E             T       C
C      QQQ QQ      GGG       SSSS       JJJ      EEEEEEE       T       C
C                                                                      C
C                                                                      C
C----------------------------------------------------------------------C
