C
C
C    Bug reports, questions, complaints are welcome
C    (please send a mail to: anatoli.fedynitch@desy.de
C
C
C    Note that the code is available with several interfaces to
C    Lund fragmentation programs (JETSET7.x, 1.x and a double
C    precision JETSET version). This file is the code with
C                interface to PYTHIA 6.4.27 (or higher)
C
C    for usage in DPMJET-III version 2017.1
C       (Lund common block dimensions increased)
C
C    Field dimensions increased by A. Fedynitch (DESY)
C       (anatoli.fedynitch@desy.de)
C
C***********************************************************************
C
C
C             List of subroutines and functions
C             ---------------------------------
C
C
C  main event simulation routines
C
C      PHO_EVENT
C      PHO_PARTON
C      PHO_POSPOM
C
C      PHO_STDPAR
C      PHO_POMSCA
C
C
C  user steering interface
C
C      PHO_SETMDL
